  "title": "Palatin to Begin Trading on Nasdaq Stock Exchange",
  "summary": "May 18, 2026, 16:00 ET PRINCETON, N.J., May 18, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Palatin Technologies, Inc. (NYSE American: PTN), a biopharmaceutical company focused on the discovery and development of novel therapeutics targeting the melanocortin receptor system, today announced that its common stock has been approved for listing on the Nasdaq Capital Market and that the Company will […]",
